    display(20, metric, nil) == "20.00°C"; projection(c:20, p:0, imperial) == "68°F";
    projection(f:68, p:0, metric) == "20°C"; sub-zero projection(c:-12.34, p:1) == "-12.3°C".
  • title toFixed(1) WITH space: source(c:21.5).title == "21.5 °C"; source(f:68).title == "68.0 °F".
  • precedence: celsius wins over fahrenheit; non-finite celsius falls through to fahrenheit.
  • empty: neither finite -> "—" + VoiceOver "No temperature data".
  • fmtNumber: en_US "1,234.50" vs de_DE "1.234,50"; halfUp 1.236->"1.24", 1.234->"1.23".
